<p>&nbsp;The platform is designed around privacy, convenience, speed and accessibility. Its applications are intended to be small and quick to open while using very little space on a device. The company states that users' files, notes and financial records remain on their own devices and that it only stores email addresses and membership details rather than the information entered into the applications. It also states that applications continue to work offline once they have been opened at least once. This allows users to access them while travelling, underground or in places without an internet connection.</p>
